            <div xml:id="d339-a3">

                <pb facs="0531" n="459" xml:id="pg459"/>

                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Commonwealth of
                        Massachusetts</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">County of Suffolk:</hi></p>
                <p>Personally appeared before me Capt. Frank P. Shepherd, master of the barkentine
                    John Baizley, who declared that he made the above protest, reserving all rights
                    or claims that he may be entitled to thereby.</p>
                <closer><signed>GEORGE C. EMERY,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Notary
                        Public.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
